body:
We don't even have to query JavaScript as we already know the answer if threads aren't enabled.

```suggestion
int OS_Web::get_default_thread_pool_size() const {
#ifdef THREADS_ENABLED
	return godot_js_os_pthread_pool_size_get();
#else // No threads.
	return 1;
#endif
}
```

